OL,3,AMove to rejoin EU among options for UK,
OL,4,ABurnham tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham says rejoining the EU is
OL,7,Famong options the government could look
OL,8,Fat - telling BBC Breakfast the current
OL,9,FBrexit settlement has caused "more harm
OL,10,Fthan good"
OL,12,FIn his conference speech, Burnham said
OL,13,Fhis government will end the existing
OL,14,Ftriple lock on state pensions from 2030
OL,15,Fto help fund social care reforms in
OL,16,FEngland
OL,18,F"Triple lock" means the state pension
OL,19,Fcurrently increases annually in line
OL,20,Fwith inflation, average wage growth, or
OL,21,F2.5% - whichever is highest
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
